### Guide §5.3 Validation & errors. VS Code REST Client syntax: click "Send Request" above each request.
### The app must be running on :8080 without the dev profile, on an empty database (the ids assume
### it). Since §5.4 the data survives restarts: reset it with docker compose -f spring-app/compose.yaml down -v
### Every error response is a ProblemDetail: Content-Type application/problem+json.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create a book with a hyphenated ISBN-10 (201). The response shows it stored as ISBN-13: 9780441013593.
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "0-441-01359-7", "title": "Dune", "publishedYear": 1965, "totalCopies": 3}

### The same book as ISBN-13 (409, detail "A book with ISBN 9780441013593 already exists")
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "9780441013593", "title": "Dune (again)", "publishedYear": 1965, "totalCopies": 1}

### Several invalid fields at once (400, errors: isbn, title, totalCopies)
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "9780441013594", "title": "", "totalCopies": -1}

### totalCopies missing (400, detail "Failed to read request", no errors map: Jackson fails before validation)
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "9780141439518", "title": "Emma"}

### Invalid body on PUT (400, errors.title). Method validation path, same shape.
PUT {{host}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "9780441013593", "title": " ", "totalCopies": 3}

### Author with a blank name and a future birth year (400, errors: birthYear, name)
POST {{host}}/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "birthYear": 3000}

### A non-positive id (400, errors.id)
GET {{host}}/api/authors/0

### An id that does not exist (404, detail "Book 999 not found")
GET {{host}}/api/books/999

### Malformed JSON (400, detail "Failed to read request")
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "9780441013593",

### A path with no endpoint (404, detail "No static resource api/nothing-here.")
GET {{host}}/api/nothing-here
